# Fuzz corpus. Machine-generated corpus entries (sha1-named) are local
# artifacts of a run and are NOT source — committing thousands of them is noise.
# Only the curated `seed-*` inputs are tracked: they seed the fuzzer with valid
# message/param/cookie shapes and pin known regressions (e.g. the multibyte
# "ѱa" cookie DoS in version_string/seed-multibyte-crash).
*
!*/
!*/seed-*
!.gitignore
